title Cassette bound at 480x800 and 800x480 (their own densities): Settings with Codec and Sample rate (no Bit depth row: the card records 16-bit only) and the Codec picker on a stereo 44.1 kHz card
sizes 480x800 800x480
env CASSETTE_DEMO 1
env CASSETTE_DEMO_HOME demo-home
env CASSETTE_DEMO_CARD stereo
env CASSETTE_DEMO_CODECS both
env CASSETTE_LAYOUT_CHECK 1

wait 1500
key s
wait 500
expect text "Codec"
expect text "Sample rate"
expect notext "Bit depth"
shot settings
expect notext "LAYOUT FAIL"
key down
key down
key enter
wait 500
shot picker-top
expect notext "LAYOUT FAIL"
key down
key down
key enter
wait 300
expect text "Not available: Opus needs 8, 12, 16, 24 or 48 kHz; this card has 44.1 kHz"
shot picker-notice
expect notext "LAYOUT FAIL"
expect noquit
